{
  "slug": "arn-spark",
  "name": "Arn Spark",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Guided greenfield pipeline from raw idea to working prototype — product discovery with AI-assisted persona generation, architecture vision, use case authoring, project scaffolding, and interactive prototype validation.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **28 skills** and **20 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (28): `arn-brainstorming` (This skill should be used when the user says \"brainstorming\", \"arn brainstorming\", \"brainstorm\", \"let's brainstorm\", \"start brainstorming\", \"brainstorming…), `arn-spark-arch-vision` (This skill should be used when the user says \"arch vision\", \"architecture vision\", \"arn arch vision\", \"define the…), `arn-spark-clickable-prototype` (This skill should be used when the user says \"clickable prototype\", \"arn clickable prototype\", \"interactive prototype\", \"test interactions\",…), `arn-spark-clickable-prototype-teams` (This skill should be used when the user says \"clickable prototype teams\", \"arn clickable prototype teams\", \"team clickable…), `arn-spark-concept-review` (This skill should be used when the user says \"concept review\", \"review concept\", \"update product concept\", \"synthesize stress…), `arn-spark-dev-setup` (This skill should be used when the user says \"dev setup\", \"arn spark dev setup\", \"development environment\", \"configure…), `arn-spark-discover` (This skill should be used when the user says \"discover\", \"product discovery\", \"arn discover\", \"help me define this…), `arn-spark-ensure-config` (This skill should be used when the user says \"ensure config\", \"check arn spark config\", \"arn-spark-ensure-config\", \"verify arn…), and 20 more\n- **Agents** (20): `arn-spark-brand-strategist` (This agent should be used when the arn-spark-naming skill needs brand strategy expertise to analyze a product's brand…), `arn-spark-dev-env-builder` (This agent should be used when the arn-spark-dev-setup skill needs to create development environment infrastructure files such as…), `arn-spark-doctor` (This agent should be used when the arn-spark-report skill needs diagnostic investigation of an Arness Spark workflow issue), `arn-spark-forensic-investigator` (This agent should be used when the arn-spark-stress-premortem skill needs to investigate hypothetical product failure using Gary Klein's…), `arn-spark-market-researcher` (This agent should be used when the arn-spark-discover skill needs competitive landscape research to identify alternatives in a…), `arn-spark-marketing-pm` (This agent should be used when the arn-spark-stress-prfaq skill needs to draft a press release and FAQ for…), `arn-spark-persona-architect` (This agent should be used when the arn-spark-discover skill needs to generate rich, realistic target user personas for…), `arn-spark-persona-impersonator` (This agent should be used when the arn-spark-stress-interview skill needs a synthetic persona to role-play during a structured…), and 12 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install arn-spark@claude-community` from `AppsVortex/arness` (`plugins/arn-spark`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
